{
 "version": 1,
 "title": "Laser Zap",
 "category": "Effects",
 "text": "Sound: the 'pew' zap and laser shot of rave and industrial tracks: a pitch that falls from very high in an instant.\n\nHow it's built: a fast envelope into the oscillator's FM, with FM at 3 octaves: each note starts three octaves up and drops to its pitch in a tenth of a second. A short amp envelope, and a Delay to fire it off into space.\n\nPlay: short stabs, anywhere on the keyboard.\n\nTweak: the pitch envelope's DECAY (slower is a falling bomb), the oscillator's FM, the delay's TIME and FEEDBACK; try the PULSE output.",
